# <type>(<scope>): <short summary of WHAT changed (max 50-72 chars)>
#
# [WHY]: What problem does this solve, or why was this change necessary?
# (e.g. root cause, performance bottleneck, bug context, or missing capability)
#
#
# [HOW/SOLUTION]: Key technical decisions, trade-offs, and changes made.
#
#
# [IMPACT/VERIFICATION]: (Optional) Benchmarks, test coverage, or side effects.
#
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Common types:
#   feat:     New user/system feature or capability
#   fix:      Bug fix or error resolution
#   perf:     Performance optimization or speedup
#   refactor: Code restructuring without behavior changes
#   test:     Adding or updating test suites
#   docs:     Documentation or comment updates
#   chore:    Tooling, dependency updates, or maintenance
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Note: Lines starting with '#' are ignored and will not appear in the commit.
